.TH HD-SCREENSAVER 7 "October 2026" "hd-desktop" "HyprDebian"
.SH NAME
hd-screensaver \- the screensaver of the HyprDebian desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hd-launch-screensaver
.br
.B hd-kill-screensaver
.SH DESCRIPTION
The package
.B hd-desktop
holds the screensaver of the HyprDebian desktop, see
.BR hd-desktop (7).
It shows a text with random effects of terminal text effects
.RB ( tte )
in a full screen kitty window on every monitor.
.PP
hypridle starts it after 2 minutes without input, and stops it before it
locks the screen with hyprlock, by
.IR ~/.config/hypr/hypridle.conf .
It also stops on a key press, or when another window gets the focus.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B hd-launch-screensaver
Start the screensaver on every monitor, unless it already runs.
It runs Hyprland's
.B hyprctl
and must run in the Hyprland session.
.TP
.B hd-cmd-screensaver
Show the text in a loop of random effects.
.B hd-launch-screensaver
runs it in each kitty window of the class
.BR hyprdebian.screensaver .
.TP
.B hd-kill-screensaver
Stop the screensaver on every monitor.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/hyprdebian/screensaver.txt
The text that the screensaver shows, when the user has one.
.TP
.I /usr/share/hd-screensaver/screensaver.txt
The text that the screensaver shows otherwise.
Copy it to
.I ~/.config/hyprdebian/screensaver.txt
to change it.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR hd-desktop (7),
.BR hypridle (1)
